				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<span class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The course fee covers tuition fees and training materials. We are open for negotiations and can customize courses based on your availability and budget. Kenyans (5 days): USD 1,200 | Kenyans (10 working days): USD 2,000 | International participants (10 working days): USD 2,500 | Monthly: USD 3,000.
</span>				</div>
